d_unique: 0`, `generation_mismatch_unique: 0`, `watchdog_lines_in_window: []`). Closes `Isolation F24-01` for the planning record and reviewer crash only; `df9dbad7` stays failed in its D-098 archive, and GitHub's 11-04 scheduled job `41836274140` stays failed with its next scheduled run pending.\n- **§14.5 / `API01` / D-162 (`#480`, isolation follow-up 26, merge `1d67b3ec4f4cc34a801daa84fb04084a8f44386c`, roadmap row `36b4c632edeed91a7c0a55e936a031340b01e0fd`):** Offline only (no Docker, no lab, no stack, no live run). Moved the Go source formerly embedded inline in `tests/e2e/at/isolation/assist.py` (which remains on `main` as an 11-line wrapper) into `tests/e2e/at/isolation/assist.go.txt` (`isolationAssist`, write at `:24`, formerly `assist.py:22`), calling shared `admin.writeNode` with `nodeFieldsMatch(capacity)` and `[]int{202}` (`208000000`/`200000000` capacity, `100000000` per-member caps), retaining `\"node_write\": write.Receipt`, and setting `\"api_ok\": write.accepted(202)` (fixing the former `\"api_ok\":e==nil`). Verified offline by `TestAPI01_IsolationAssist` in `tests/e2e/at/isolation/assist_offline_test.go.txt` (`5` subtests: `accepted`, `conflict_then_accepted`, `non_conflict`, `wrong_412_code`, `already_intended`) and `TestAPI01_AssistNodeWriteUsesSharedHelper` in `tests/e2e/at/isolation/driver_writes_test.go`. The [frozen D-162 source audit](../tests/handover/testdata/history/follow-up-48/docs_e2e_at_isolation_followup26-2026-11-04.md.txt#d-162-reach-source-audit) records every config at lines 81–97 and routed consumer at lines 99–114: prepare writes `observation_seconds: 5` to both prepared configs; the observer overrides only runtime heartbeat/poll/observation to `1/1/1` before acceptance. Main runtime remains `1 s` before and after D-162, enrollment remains `5 s`, and auxiliary/clone runtime inherits `1 s`. The clone copies the source's existing durable auxiliary config; config inheritance alone does not prove a working observation route. **Chec